# (1) Felmy & Weare, Geochim. Cosmochim. Acta 50 (1986) 2771, Table 1, p. 2772: the species
#     molalities the PAPER'S OWN MODEL calculates for borax-saturated water at 25 C, totals
#     Na 0.323 and boron 0.081 + 0.131 + 3 x 0.050 + 4 x 0.071 = 0.646.  IN-SAMPLE: an output of the
#     fit these parameters came from, not a measurement; it holds the transcription and the engine's
#     implementation of the Pitzer-HMW sums with neutral, ion-pair and polyborate terms.  The
#     tolerance 5e-2 is three printed digits (a +-0.0005 on .050 is 1 %) plus the engine's different
#     convention for the water mass and rounding of the paper's constants; the measured
#     deviations are m_H3BO3 -1.9 %, m_BOH4 +0.07 %, m_B3O3OH4 +3.4 %, m_B4O5OH4 -1.3 %.
